  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/9f1f11fbb4e091305a6b414e74c3aec25b8d519670a1f3bd65f5bd4eb1bdcd68.png] \n\nGiven equation: 98 * 49 * 7 * 74 * 55 * 3\n\nOption 1) ÷,−, +,×, = \n\nSigns to sequentially replace the * signs then:\n\n⇒ __**98 ÷ 49**__ - 7 + 74 × 55 = 3\n\n⇒ 2 - 7 + __**74 × 55**__ = 3\n\n⇒ __**2**__ - 7 __**+ 4070**__ = 3\n\n⇒ __**4072 - 7**__ = 3\n\n⇒ 4065 ≠ 3\n\n**Option 2) −, ÷, +, =,×**\n\nSigns to sequentially replace the * signs then:\n\n⇒ 98 - __**49 ÷ 7**__ + 74 = __**55 × 3**__\n\n⇒** __98__** - 7 __**+ 74 **__= 165\n\n⇒ __**172 - 7**__ = 165\n\n⇒ **165 = 165**\n\nOption 3) −, ÷, +,×, =\n\nSigns to sequentially replace the * signs then:\n\n⇒ 98 - __**49 ÷ 7**__ + 74 × 55 = 3\n\n⇒ 98 - 7 + __**74 × 55**__ = 3\n\n⇒ __**98**__ - 7 __**+ 4070**__ = 3\n\n⇒ __**4168 - 7**__ = 3\n\n⇒ 4161 ≠ 3\n\nOption 4) ÷,−,×, +, =\n\nSigns to sequentially replace the * signs then:\n\n⇒ __**98 ÷ 49**__ - 7 × 74 + 55 = 3\n\n⇒ 2 - __**7 × 74**__ + 55 = 3\n\n⇒ __**2**__ - 518 __**+ 55**__ = 3\n\n⇒ __**57 - 518**__ = 3\n\n⇒ - 461 ≠ 3\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"−, ÷, +, =,×\".**",
